1 REM FBCS SEG-0605
2 REM CLAIM A-9.1.2-TR162
3 REM TYPE OUTPUT
4 REM 9.1.2 l.4194-4205: an internal FUNCTION of the main shadows an external FUNCTION of the same name; a
5 REM unit with DECLARE EXTERNAL FUNCTION uses the external one.
10 DECLARE EXTERNAL SUB E
20 FUNCTION Q(X)
30 LET Q = X + 1
40 END FUNCTION
50 PRINT Q(1)
60 CALL E
70 END
100 EXTERNAL SUB E
110 DECLARE EXTERNAL FUNCTION Q
120 PRINT Q(1)
130 END SUB
200 EXTERNAL FUNCTION Q(X)
210 LET Q = X + 100
220 END FUNCTION
